{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["The sense of <b>and you shall keep My statutes and My ordinances</b> is to make clear that they are life to those who do them in both worlds, for whoever understands their sod — the Living of the World sustains him in life, and he shall not die forever. Therefore it is written, 'I am YHWH your Elohim,' as I have explained."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:37.951767852Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}